Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, libssl3, zlib1g, libpulse0, libx11-6, libxrandr2, libxi6, libxcursor1, libxinerama1, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libharfbuzz0b, libglib2.0-0, libgl1, libegl1, libice6, libsm6, libdbus-1-3, libatspi2.0-0, gir1.2-atspi-2.0, python3, python3-gi, tesseract-ocr, udev, wl-clipboard, wmctrl, x11-utils, xclip, xdg-desktop-portal, xdg-utils
Homepage: https://hyperwhisper.com
Description: Private, fast speech-to-text for Linux
 HyperWhisper records speech and turns it into text using local or cloud
 transcription engines. This package contains the self-contained amd64 Linux
 desktop application and its native runtime.
